    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**Detached Residence with Panoramic Views of Broadhaven Bay**\r\n\r\nLocated in Attycunnane on the outskirts of Belmullet, this well presented four-bedroom detached home offers a great blend of coastal living and modern convenience. Enjoying views across the waters of Broadhaven Bay, this exceptional property provides an ideal setting for family living or as a holiday home.\r\n\r\nThe property boasts bright and spacious accommodation throughout, with well-proportioned living spaces designed to maximise the stunning bay views. The four generous bedrooms provide ample space for family and guests, while the surrounding grounds offer privacy to the side and rear with a generous lawn to the front.\r\n\r\nIdeally situated within walking distance of Belmullet town and just a two-minute drive from the town centre, residents can enjoy easy access to a wide range of local amenities including shops, schools, cafés, restaurants, and traditional pubs.\r\n\r\nOutdoor enthusiasts will appreciate the property's proximity to the renowned Belmullet Tidal Pool, scenic coastal walks, and the many recreational activities that the area has to offer. Whether it's swimming, fishing, boating, or simply enjoying this breathtaking part of the Wild Atlantic Way, this location caters to every lifestyle."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "* Detached four-bedroom family home\r\n* Outstanding views across Broadhaven Bay\r\n* Bright and spacious accommodation throughout\r\n* Peaceful coastal setting\r\n* Walking distance to Belmullet town\r\n* Just a two-minute drive to the town centre\r\n* Close to schools, shops, pubs, restaurants, and local services\r\n* Minutes from the famous Belmullet Tidal Pool\r\n* Ideal family home, holiday residence, or investment property\r\n* Convenient access to the Wild Atlantic Way\r\n\r\nOffering an exceptional combination of location, views, and convenience, this attractive home presents a rare opportunity to acquire a quality property in one of Mayo's most scenic coastal settings. Early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
